	p111 := pf.SetElem(0, uint32(pw95[0])|uint32(pw95[1])<<8|uint32(pw95[2])<<16|uint32(pw95[3])<<24).ReshapeToUint8s().ExtendLo8ToUint16().BitsToInt16()
	o112 := p111.Add(s110).SaturateToUint8().ReshapeToUint32s().GetElem(0)
